# HydroCascade — Doc 10 §8 rule 4:
# data/ is gitignored EXCEPT PROVENANCE.md files, the catalog, and the
# reference list. The reference list is hand-curated provenance work, not a
# derived artefact: losing it loses an afternoon in the KSDMA and EMS archives,
# and the recall test has no denominator without it.
data/*
!data/catalog/
!data/reference/
!data/**/PROVENANCE.md

# but never commit large intermediates even inside catalog/
data/catalog/*.parquet
data/catalog/*.gpkg

.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Generated outputs are reproducible from the pipeline
figures/*.png
!figures/.gitkeep
